[en.IDEA_C12_PUNISHMENT_OF_LAS_PEGASUS]
Punishment of Las Pegasus

[en.IDEA_C12_PUNISHMENT_OF_LAS_PEGASUS_desc]
In punishment for our breach of the agreement, Las Pegasus has imposed an embargo on us. At the same time, the equipment previously provided to us as aid has started to malfunction. We will need a long time to overcome this difficult situation, but we have no other choice.

[zh.IDEA_C12_PUNISHMENT_OF_LAS_PEGASUS]
破坏协议的惩罚

[zh.IDEA_C12_PUNISHMENT_OF_LAS_PEGASUS_desc]
为了惩罚我们对协议的破坏，洛马基对我们实施了禁运，同时此前援助给我们的设备也开始出现了问题，我们需要很长时间才能度过这段难关，但我们别无选择
